  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Information about roads under MNR jurisdiction may fall within the responsibility of several different ministry branches and including:</span></div><div><ul><li><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Forests Division</span></li><li><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Parks, Lands &amp; Waters Branch</span></li><li><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Resource access roads</span></li></ul></div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>This class has related tables. </span><a target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets?q=RT_MNRRDSEG' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>MNR Road Segments related tables</span></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><p><a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/MNRRDSEG_Non_Passable_Roads.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>MNR Road Segments Non-Passable Roads (File Geodatabase)</a></p><p>This non-passable roads dataset may not reflect the most current non-passable road information. For immediate access to non-passable roads not included in this download, please contact the layer custodian.</p><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></span></div><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/DD%20MNRF%20Road%20Segment,%20MNR%20Road%20Network%20(2026-03-31).docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Data Dictionary (Word)</a></li></ul></div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Status</strong></span></div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>On going: data is being continually updated</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong></span></div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Irregular: data is updated in intervals that are uneven in duration</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Contact</strong></span></div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Shawn Mason, Regional IM Specialist</span></div><ul><li><div><a href='mailto:shawn.mason@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>shawn.mason@ontario.ca</span></a></div></li></ul>"
